    "build_reachable_diff_lines": 27728,
    "reachability": "Static in-module import walk from main for linux amd64/arm64, CGO=0, tag timetzdata; 98 packages reachable, all inside cmd/ internal/ pkg/; mocks and testutil packages unreachable.",
    "method": "All non-test blobs fetched by Git blob SHA and re-hashed. Import-only hunks separated mechanically. Entire build-reachable substantive diff screened for new hosts/URLs, HTTP clients, exec/syscall, env reads/writes, file writes, embeds, linkname, plugin loading, encoded payloads; network, credential, process, filesystem and notification chains read in full. Pure refactor/transform lines (type moves types.Container→container.Container, renames, comments) were screened but not individually line-read.",
    "outside_build": "docs/, .github/, build/, tools/tplprev, examples/, CHANGELOG, Taskfile, test files: path/blob verified only."
  },
  "in_module_findings": [
    "No new functional package except internal/update/params (plain settings struct); new */mocks packages unreachable from main.",
    "Only hardcoded URL literals in the module remain swagger metadata and the legacy Slack webhook prefix; no new external endpoint.",
    "Registry digest lookup: bearer token sent only to the registry/mirror endpoint; cross-origin redirects retried without the token; URLs redacted in logs.",
    "Lifecycle hook exec (existing feature): output now tail-bounded to 2KiB, made printable and URL userinfo redacted before logs/notifications; timeout covers attach.",
    "Settings loader replaces viper with pflag+env: reads only operator env keys, operator-named secret files, WATCHTOWER_COOLDOWN_PLATFORM_* env.",
    "Compose apply exports operator DOCKER_* connection settings into the process env for Compose-started build tools; unset when empty.",
    "Git project checkout (existing): local dirty-file snapshot in temp dir, removed after restore; provider probes target the repository's own host.",
    "Notifications: Shoutrrr URLs remain operator-configured; legacy settings converted to Shoutrrr URLs with redacted logging."
  ],
