    "changed_and_build_reachable": 38,
    "provenance": "Every changed build-reachable module: old and new zips fetched from proxy.golang.org, h1 recomputed and matched both go.sum and sum.golang.org.",
    "sensitive_screen": "Reachable-package diffs (non-test .go/.s) screened for exec, syscall, env, file writes, dial/HTTP construction, init, linkname, embed, plugin, base64 decode and new host literals.",
    "findings": [
      "docker/compose v5.8.0: buildx bake exec moved from pkg/compose/build_bake.go to internal/build/bake.go with the same plugin lookup and environment; remote git/OCI include caches (existing feature) write under the compose cache dir with 0700/0600.",
      "moby/extensions (new, moby org repo, proxy Origin commit 2b6b3bd matches GitHub): extension-point registry and a gRPC client whose only dialer is the Docker engine connection; no process start.",
